    "description": "A mature French man in his early sixties with a low baritone, earthy, slightly hoarse and grainy timbre. He sounds like a warm, frank, experienced rugby coach from southwest France. He speaks naturally in French, with lively, confident, expressive delivery and a moderate pace. Friendly conversational tone, clear diction, brief pauses between sentences, energetic without shouting. A subtle southwestern French accent, never exaggerated. Dry studio recording without music or background sounds.",
