  "sourceTextFile": "E:\\Cadrage-Debordement\\artefacts\\session-staff-gameplay-20261108\\coach-voice-clips-input.json",
  "sourceTextSha256": "7e09d64c40402a158435ef70ba07b10e761be4f18abfe2cbce5281f9d3bd3f66",
  "clips": [
    {
      "text": "Choisir un club, c'est choisir les gens avec qui on va vivre la saison. Regarde la division et l'objectif avant de prendre les rênes.",
      "textSha256": "49d595cd2e65513931e3caa0b514560d97a6d036db5055aeeca0039f9f32d93e",
      "sha256": "3bd4e788581bec2ee1825db97939920415d9e3d67934f3acbacf9cf15dda13ad",
      "file": "club-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.36,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 13.64,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.73046875,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "club-01",
      "pageId": "club",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "49d595cd2e65513931e3caa0b514560d97a6d036db5055aeeca0039f9f32d93e"
    },
    {
      "text": "Avant de parler de tactique, connais ton groupe. Poste, condition, disponibilité : commence par là, puis ouvre une fiche. Un bon joueur fatigué reste un joueur fatigué.",
      "textSha256": "a023827a0415f7092b591bed76813f0e0eecdcd444f9c9d63fb436d36dfc1e1b",
      "sha256": "7c246c7893cb5b6ab38ff32441886e1bb29f8825ae2a93fc8a64990ef49cd369",
      "file": "effectif-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 17.87,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.6796875,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "effectif-01",
      "pageId": "effectif",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "a023827a0415f7092b591bed76813f0e0eecdcd444f9c9d63fb436d36dfc1e1b"
    },
    {
      "text": "Vérifie toute la feuille avant de partir. Pendant le match, les changements se feront dans l'onglet Banc, en pause. Et le dernier mot reste le tien.",
      "textSha256": "291a060cb58c29a16c5de0737c24da7150738d73230bee4cc19937fce4fed734",
      "sha256": "354ab87c1dc0863e159b6af9aaf668d84dc9725c282fedc69edcae7e6c2f758b",
      "file": "composition-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.76,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 18.98,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.65234375,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "composition-02",
      "pageId": "composition",
      "segmentIndex": 2,
      "listeningReviewNote": "Banc transcribed banque by both Whisper variants. May reflect ASR lexical prior or pronunciation; human listening not confirmed.",
      "text_sha256": "291a060cb58c29a16c5de0737c24da7150738d73230bee4cc19937fce4fed734"
    },
    {
      "text": "Faire transpirer tout le monde, c'est facile. Faire progresser le groupe sans le mettre à plat, voilà le métier.",
      "textSha256": "804b43cee33d89200bc3623468040fed627bc08cd2750338a7ab3582c97c46b8",
      "sha256": "1cce88e19ba5b8d6c3de3fb84626bbfd16b5051b3488bac89ba7428fdb076196",
      "file": "entrainement-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 7.44,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 14.14,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.80859375,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "entrainement-01",
      "pageId": "entrainement",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "804b43cee33d89200bc3623468040fed627bc08cd2750338a7ab3582c97c46b8"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prépare-la avant le coup d'envoi, avec le prochain match en tête.",
      "textSha256": "c6bd35b4604e66f6f6b5ae671c1ca15ac0f05384177d202711f475feb6e51c90",
      "sha256": "8f1997227b0fee16ba2ee5a8b47753e7305da14519c683e75da6f0093f901c5f",
      "file": "entrainement-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 4.08,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 7.31,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.734375,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "entrainement-03",
      "pageId": "entrainement",
      "segmentIndex": 3,
      "text_sha256": "c6bd35b4604e66f6f6b5ae671c1ca15ac0f05384177d202711f475feb6e51c90"
    },
    {
      "text": "Un plan, il faut pouvoir l'expliquer simplement. Lis le dossier adverse, puis choisis ton attaque et ta défense. Le conseil du staff donne des raisons, pas une recette miracle.",
      "textSha256": "b4e717f8166390fa98804920f9c7aa0c82cfbef745f8038302d0e256f54e2164",
      "sha256": "29bc86b73a002eabc658e0255e9fa1617f3793b3b9cf4e07b7bf1103fd17e26a",
      "file": "tactique-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.84,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 19.25,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.7421875,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "tactique-01",
      "pageId": "tactique",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "b4e717f8166390fa98804920f9c7aa0c82cfbef745f8038302d0e256f54e2164"
    },
    {
      "text": "Le résultat est là. Gagné ou perdu, on prend le temps de comprendre. Regarde la conquête, la discipline et la réussite au but, puis les moments du match.",
      "textSha256": "cca38c12da2b9fe19e76a1ef09e666405b721e75781795009f84222524d1caa4",
      "sha256": "20e4ce7f73760717a13788b91ce2209520bbcc020090dde48d51d476358cb9e6",
      "file": "resultat-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.72,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 17.96,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.828125,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "resultat-01",
      "pageId": "resultat",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "cca38c12da2b9fe19e76a1ef09e666405b721e75781795009f84222524d1caa4"
    },
    {
      "text": "Une saison, c'est long. Regarde ce qui vient avant de demander encore un effort aux mêmes joueurs. Ici, tu retrouves les résultats et les rencontres à jouer.",
      "textSha256": "762d8527547f4c22610f77960e44faa7a9c35e4d35df9258d745a369088de93e",
      "sha256": "ade4aa354095731742d40de24e18ede111dfcc935e3821a9ab491a51dd4ff521",
      "file": "calendrier-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.48,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 14.72,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.69140625,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "calendrier-01",
      "pageId": "calendrier",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "762d8527547f4c22610f77960e44faa7a9c35e4d35df9258d745a369088de93e"
    },
    {
      "text": "Le classement, on le regarde en face. Points, matchs joués, différence : vérifie tout avant de comparer.",
      "textSha256": "3b3f64b6be08f1239c116ee73872a3f0337fd6ee720188fc206630e88541fd11",
      "sha256": "40d727f26f684ea46df9d237dadaeec6c285dcf0cbad08691067e24025b23f9d",
      "file": "classements-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 7.44,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 12.54,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.7421875,
      "seed": 271109,
      "id": "classements-01",
      "pageId": "classements",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "generationMethod": "Second take with unchanged text and same synthetic reference; seed 271109",
      "text_sha256": "3b3f64b6be08f1239c116ee73872a3f0337fd6ee720188fc206630e88541fd11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue à construire.",
      "textSha256": "254f3c596e5afefef03f969d0a39cd945d37ed5355a96c45acd7e1274c711490",
      "sha256": "320dfbe7dde15d93983930f3e6189dbdb5658d0ebb888faaa5429adac7ff41e4",
      "file": "classements-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 1.6,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 2.75,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.63671875,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "classements-03",
      "pageId": "classements",
      "segmentIndex": 3,
      "listeningReviewNote": "Whisper small writes Continuez, Whisper base writes exact Continue. Human listening not confirmed.",
      "text_sha256": "254f3c596e5afefef03f969d0a39cd945d37ed5355a96c45acd7e1274c711490"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dans mon premier club, on comptait jusqu'aux ampoules du vestiaire. Ici aussi, regarde les moyens avant de promettre.",
      "textSha256": "d6407080c422fa86600c0fb0d665e8c41747eb46d5f21df4a16fbffa48b393fe",
      "sha256": "e1b2bd7becc055fd6d94af12760fd6aa26f9504d2a3735bc39e0d648a8855ce5",
      "file": "finances-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 7.44,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 11.31,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.79296875,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "finances-01",
      "pageId": "finances",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "d6407080c422fa86600c0fb0d665e8c41747eb46d5f21df4a16fbffa48b393fe"
    },
    {
      "text": "Avant de chercher un grand nom, cherche ce qui manque à ton équipe. Regarde la couverture des postes et les fins de contrat. Une piste te plaît ?",
      "textSha256": "06f1768ee58ccdcf5a806ab90e606947c452e0d4d69e1e05860d66e5b914eb79",
      "sha256": "4df4d406bb9ce1a81d147bde97eac653f7b09f1e036a49068e9cf9943a9960cb",
      "file": "recrutement-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.16,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 17.34,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.85546875,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "recrutement-01",
      "pageId": "recrutement",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "06f1768ee58ccdcf5a806ab90e606947c452e0d4d69e1e05860d66e5b914eb79"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lis le salaire, la durée et le coût avant de proposer. Une contre-offre, ça se discute ; une promesse, ça se tient. Et une proposition n'est pas encore une signature.",
      "textSha256": "2975e833a55c99d1b30404a1ab7dcac8bb7e648d20b679c018f29c072a9ffff0",
      "sha256": "35d0f8e2e145a1e9a5fee5198dcd693bba6571da048f6415c7eee1dc2e50e777",
      "file": "recrutement-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12.56,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 19.37,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.7421875,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "recrutement-02",
      "pageId": "recrutement",
      "segmentIndex": 2,
      "text_sha256": "2975e833a55c99d1b30404a1ab7dcac8bb7e648d20b679c018f29c072a9ffff0"
    },
    {
      "text": "Regarde un peu autour de nous. Un club, c'est une ville, un stade et des gens qui reviennent, même sous la pluie.",
      "textSha256": "443f8021c117ed49467507ee45c4e3b0ed716558a488298d2feb0fa449f29008",
      "sha256": "50d103b0c68fd91fa66d79176758fd6a5cead7437fdf31eeaa91983081e82445",
      "file": "territoire-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 7.76,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 11.49,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.7734375,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "territoire-01",
      "pageId": "territoire",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "443f8021c117ed49467507ee45c4e3b0ed716558a488298d2feb0fa449f29008"
    },
    {
      "text": "Un jeune, ça se prépare ; ça ne se presse pas comme un citron.",
      "textSha256": "81f8fc124a9af452e20e2fc4bb95e5ee52cfc6290bc9e59c7e6414ad913cdf4d",
      "sha256": "e544f0ca830ba0fe0d1ff6f4d66066536d43c44bfb0c2e094f57be2c789385da",
      "file": "formation-03.wav",
